# End-to-End Testing Plan — OpenmindProjects Donation Platform

## Overview

This plan defines a comprehensive testing strategy for the full OpenmindProjects donation platform, covering both **backend API test gap coverage** and **full-stack Playwright browser E2E tests** across all critical user flows.

---

## Design Decisions Summary

| Decision | Choice |
|---|---|
| **E2E Framework** | Playwright |
| **Stripe Handling** | Real Stripe test mode API calls |
| **Email Validation** | Gmail workspace (real integrated email) |
| **Google OAuth** | Real OAuth flow with dedicated test Gmail account |
| **Test Database** | Dedicated `omp_test` PostgreSQL database (`prisma migrate reset --force`) |
| **Browsers** | Chromium only |
| **Viewports** | Desktop (1280×720) + Mobile (375×667 iPhone SE) |
| **Failure Artifacts** | Screenshots on failure + video for failed tests only |
| **CI/CD** | GitHub Actions — API tests on push/PR, Playwright nightly |

